+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# STAP ANTI-JAM (antsdr-fw-patch 0003) BEGIN
+#   Ported from LoopBack_Code_SMI_PI_STAP6x6_v4.9.14 (Source/BlockDesign/
+#   system_bd.tcl, MOD-1 and MOD-2), into the ANTSDR E310 "ant" design:
