+#     - gnss_passthrough v4.9.14 (registers at 0x43C1_0000) between the
+#       axi_ad9361 ADC outputs and DAC inputs, feeding the SMI-PI space-time
+#       filter smi_pi_0 (Vitis HLS, 6 + 6 taps, sys_cpu_clk) through two
